{"id":"269436ff8ae92754","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-walk.md","title":"ZFC Ordinal8 Ordinal Walk","display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-walk — ZFC Ordinal8 Ordinal Walk","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-walk","aliases":["58-df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-walk"],"display":"df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-walk — ZFC Ordinal8 Ordinal Walk","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-club]]","[[58-df-ordinal]]","[[58-df-limitordinal]]","[[58-df-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-walk"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-walk</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-walk — ZFC Ordinal8 Ordinal Walk"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"04670bdc8b64b8dd\" href=\"?note=04670bdc8b64b8dd\" title=\"58-df-club\">58-df-club</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"58-df-ordinal\">58-df-ordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"81cabbac7fa4d75d\" href=\"?note=81cabbac7fa4d75d\" title=\"58-df-limitordinal\">58-df-limitordinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta,C,w\\in V\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta,C,w\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> are from the dependencies</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalWalk}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalWalk}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}walk}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalWalk}_S(w,C,\\alpha,\\beta)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha\\in\\beta\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists B_C\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(C,\\beta+1,B_C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\beta+1\\;\n(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\to\\operatorname{Club}(C(\\delta),\\delta))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\beta\\;(C(\\delta+1)=\\{\\delta\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(w,n+1,\\beta+1)\\land w(0)=\\beta\\land w(n)=\\alpha\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\n\\bigl(C(w(i))\\setminus\\alpha\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land w(i+1)=\\min(C(w(i))\\setminus\\alpha)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}walk}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalWalk}_S(w,C,\\alpha,\\beta)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha\\in\\beta\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists B_C\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(C,\\beta+1,B_C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\beta+1\\;\n(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\to\\operatorname{Club}(C(\\delta),\\delta))\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\beta\\;(C(\\delta+1)=\\{\\delta\\})\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(w,n+1,\\beta+1)\\land w(0)=\\beta\\land w(n)=\\alpha\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{7em}\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\n\\bigl(C(w(i))\\setminus\\alpha\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land w(i+1)=\\min(C(w(i))\\setminus\\alpha)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Every successor step now carries the nonemptiness side condition needed for the partial minimum expression.  The club/successor clauses ensure all candidates are ordinals below the current node.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-club","status":"resolved","id":"04670bdc8b64b8dd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-club]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-limitordinal","status":"resolved","id":"81cabbac7fa4d75d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-limitordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta,C,w\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal},\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Club}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalWalk}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}ordinal8\\text{-}ordinal\\text{-}walk}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalWalk}_S(w,C,\\alpha,\\beta)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\beta)\\land\\alpha\\in\\beta\\\\\n&\\land\\exists B_C\\in V\\;\\mathrm{Function}(C,\\beta+1,B_C)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\beta+1\\;\n(\\mathrm{LimitOrdinal}_S(\\delta)\\to\\operatorname{Club}(C(\\delta),\\delta))\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\delta\\in\\beta\\;(C(\\delta+1)=\\{\\delta\\})\\\\\n&\\land\\exists n\\in\\omega\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(w,n+1,\\beta+1)\\land w(0)=\\beta\\land w(n)=\\alpha\\\\\n&\\hspace{7em}\\land\\forall i\\in n\\;\n\\bigl(C(w(i))\\setminus\\alpha\\neq\\varnothing\n\\land w(i+1)=\\min(C(w(i))\\setminus\\alpha)\\bigr)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1631,"backlinks":[{"id":"dbf3319a52b0adf6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcOrdinal8OrdinalWalk}_S:V^4\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-walk.md]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3015","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-walk.md|58-df-zfc-ordinal8-ordinal-walk]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","04670bdc8b64b8dd","5582a281f15a33c2","81cabbac7fa4d75d","36d7463d215be751"]}